WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:10.340
Where are you?

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:13.800
Please don't take my children

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.200
Open... Open your eyes!

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.100
Please don't take my children!

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:32.400
How have you been feeling? Have you been sleeping any better?

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.920
- Oh rough. Then again I've never slept well before of this...condition.

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:38.420
Condition?

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:41.900
That's called pregnancy. It's okay to say it out loud.

00:00:50.269 --> 00:00:52.600
Some things happen. Can you just please drive ?

00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:53.100
Did you see something?

00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.500
Come inside!

00:01:03.780 --> 00:01:05.200
What's going on?

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:10.800
People describe seeing an entity that takes in a form of your worst fear.

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:13.200
-Oh, my God!                                                    
-What are you looking at? What did you see?

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.600
What is wrong with you? Please, stop it!

00:01:20.369 --> 00:01:21.500
We can't stay here.

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:24.540
Every contact we've had with the outside...

00:01:25.869 --> 00:01:27.700
Has brought us death.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:30.200
Your kids they deserve hope.

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.200
Every single decision I have made has been for them

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:47.100
They're gone.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.760
Cover your eyes! Hold on!

00:01:54.610 --> 00:01:55.400
Listen to me.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.420
We're going on a trip now. It's going to be rough.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:01.340
Hold on!

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:05.700
If you hear something in the woods, you tell me.

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.700
If you hear something in the water, you tell me.

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:15.900
But under no circumstance...

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:18.900
are you allowed to take off your blindfold!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.400
Did you hear that?

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.500
The creatures!

